  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This task is to ensure that properties relating to Binary resources should reside (and be manipulated) on the associated Non-RDF Source Description.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Additionally, all RDF that is returned in response to requests on the Non-RDF Source Description should have a single subject: the Binary resource.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Although users should not be allowed to update properties directly on Binary resources, the triples in the following response should all have the subject of the Binary resource:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://gist.github.com/yulgit1/b5dd01305bec7883831c"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://gist.github.com/yulgit1/b5dd01305bec7883831c",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Likely related to: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/issues/814"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/issues/814",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
